  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hurricane Ian Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As Hurricane Ian hit southwest Florida, we witnessed firsthand the massive amounts of destruction and loss. We saw entire homes washed away, businesses bombarded with water and dreams destroyed. Within the first 4 hours of landfall, we had 3 rescues near the downtown area alone; 22 overall.  These residents really did lose everything. The storm surge washed out entire city areas (like Arcadia, Sanibel and Ft Myers Beach). We want to help them by providing essentials to cope in the months ahead.</narrative>
  </description>
